# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Source workbooks stay out of the repo.
#
# Entrant names ARE fine to commit — this is a personal site and the pool's own
# weekly mailing already shares them with all 270 entrants. See CLAUDE.md
# "Data & Privacy".
#
# The workbooks themselves are excluded because they carry the commissioner's
# personal email and cell number in every sheet footer. The parsers pull only
# games, numbers, and picks, so nothing downstream needs the raw files.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

*.xlsx
*.xls
*.xlsm

# Upstream repos cloned by scripts/build_team_identity.py. Several hundred MB of
# other people's git history; the assets it extracts ARE committed, so nothing
# here needs keeping. Delete it freely — the next build re-clones.
.cache/

# Local scratch
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
__pycache__/
*.pyc
